message: If you use this assessment corpus, please cite it as below.
type: dataset
title: "Economics and Finance Assessment Benchmark Lab"
abstract: >-
  A laboratory for authoring and verifying 10-option economics and finance
  assessment items. The corpus includes accepted items with uniqueness
  audits and a rejected-item file for each major verification defect.
